        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is a hammer drill worth buying for home use?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "If your home has brick, block or concrete walls, a combi drill costs only a little more than a plain drill driver and removes an entire category of frustration. If everything is timber-framed with plasterboard, the hammer function will rarely be used.",
